---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { SITE } from '../data/site';
---
<Base title="Terms & Conditions | PhotoEditingPrompt.com" desc="The terms for using PhotoEditingPrompt.com: free prompts, how you may use them, and our limits of responsibility.">
  <div class="narrow">
    <nav class="crumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a> › Terms &amp; Conditions</nav>
    <h1 class="page-title" style="font-size:clamp(30px,5vw,44px);margin:28px 0 20px">Terms &amp; Conditions</h1>
    <div class="prose">
      <p>Last updated: 23 November 2026.</p>
      <p>Welcome to {SITE.name}. These Terms &amp; Conditions govern your use of <a class="link" href="/">{SITE.domain}</a> (the "Website"). By using the Website you agree to them. If you do not agree, please stop using the Website.</p>
      <h2>1. What the Website is</h2>
      <p>{SITE.name} is a free library of written prompts that you can copy and paste into AI tools such as ChatGPT and Google Gemini to edit your own photos. We publish prompts and example pictures. We do not edit your photos, and we do not receive them.</p>
      <h2>2. Who may use it</h2>
      <p>The Website is intended for people aged 13 and over. If the minimum age of digital consent in your country is higher, you must meet it, or have a parent or guardian's permission.</p>
      <h2>3. Using the prompts</h2>
      <p>You may copy and use any prompt on the Website for your own personal or commercial photos and projects, and you may keep and use the images you generate with them, subject to the terms of the AI tool you use. You may share links to our pages.</p>
      <h2>4. What you may not do</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Use the Website or prompts to create unlawful, hateful, defamatory, sexually explicit or deceptive content, or to impersonate a real person without their permission.</li>
        <li>Upload photos of other people without their consent, or photos of children without a parent or guardian's consent.</li>
        <li>Copy, scrape or republish our prompt library, example images or articles in bulk, or build a competing prompt library or dataset from them, without our written permission.</li>
        <li>Attack, overload or try to gain unauthorised access to the Website, or use automated tools that harm its performance.</li>
        <li>Remove our credit or watermark from our example images and present them as your own.</li>
      </ul>
      <h2>5. Intellectual property</h2>
      <p>The prompts, text, design, code and example images on the Website belong to {SITE.name} unless stated otherwise. The names ChatGPT, Gemini, Pinterest and other third-party names are trademarks of their owners; we are not affiliated with, endorsed by or sponsored by them.</p>
      <h2>6. AI-generated content and results</h2>
      <p>Our example images are AI-generated and are shown to illustrate what a prompt can do. Your own results will differ and are not guaranteed: AI tools can change faces, add or remove details or refuse requests, and their behaviour changes over time. You are responsible for how you use the prompts and the images you create, and for following the terms of the AI tool you use and the law that applies to you. The "Tested" badge means we ran the prompt ourselves at the time; it is not a promise about future results.</p>
      <h2>7. Third-party links and tools</h2>
      <p>The Website links to third-party websites and AI tools. We do not control them and are not responsible for their content, availability, pricing, privacy practices or terms. Using them is at your own risk.</p>
      <h2>8. Availability and changes</h2>
      <p>The Website is provided free of charge. We may add, change or remove prompts, pages or features, or suspend the Website, at any time without notice, and we do not promise it will always be available or error-free.</p>
      <h2>9. Disclaimer of warranties</h2>
      <p>The Website and everything on it is provided "as is" and "as available", without warranties of any kind, express or implied, including fitness for a particular purpose, accuracy or non-infringement. Prompts and information are for general creative and educational use.</p>
      <h2>10. Limitation of liability</h2>
      <p>To the fullest extent permitted by law, {SITE.name} and the people who run it are not liable for any indirect, incidental or consequential loss, or for loss of data, images, profits or goodwill, arising from your use of the Website, the prompts, or any third-party AI tool. Nothing in these Terms excludes liability that cannot be excluded under applicable law.</p>
      <h2>11. Copyright complaints</h2>
      <p>If you believe something on the Website infringes your copyright, please follow the steps on our <a class="link" href="/copyright/">Copyright &amp; Takedown</a> page.</p>
      <h2>12. Changes to these Terms</h2>
      <p>We may update these Terms from time to time. Changes take effect when posted, and the "last updated" date above shows the latest version. Continued use of the Website means you accept the updated Terms.</p>
      <h2>13. Governing law</h2>
      <p>These Terms are governed by the laws of India. Disputes arising from them are subject to the courts of India, unless the law of your country gives you the right to bring a claim elsewhere.</p>
      <h2>14. Contact</h2>
      <p>Questions about these Terms: <a class="link" href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}>{SITE.email}</a> or our <a class="link" href="/contact/">contact page</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Base>
